{"title":"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/6/54675262613c738ebcda945ba24e724adcc28a7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(z)=az^{2018}+bz^{2017}+cz^{2016}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"236\" height=\"19\" /> has real coefficients not exceeding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/9/f49e1f42131f302f2b4a45393cdc3fed5be2655c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2019$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/4/4844c40ea2203b426bb82fc05a6eb979b7dbda93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(\\tfrac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2}\\right)=2015+2019\\sqrt{3}i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"227\" height=\"32\" />. Find the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/5/bb5b19bf7575fdc3655bb5767980f09dbb747a8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/3/e2351789d55237739fe6b2d761e7c9315e584ca6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2} = \\omega$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"101\" height=\"41\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/0/8a059285f5cc19439fb2ce0ceef3bf09b0de4c18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega = e^{\\frac{i\\pi}{3}}$\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" /> is a primitive 6th root of unity. Then we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f7174369752b3fc8715a3c6f97052e76c3385ad.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} f(\\omega) &amp;= a\\omega^{2018} + b\\omega^{2017} + c\\omega^{2016}\\\\ &amp;= a\\omega^2 + b\\omega + c \\end{align*}\" width=\"246\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p>We wish to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/6/556e2bff6ca1adcb77160fc88fdbc0aa246be1cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = a+b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"128\" height=\"18\" />. We first look at the real parts. As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/1/5c1cd64c300dd7dd0955c70f0cb57c375f8030e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Re}(\\omega^2) = -\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"103\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/d/0cd28fcb551c825aa73fca654dd187e0831e6722.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Re}(\\omega) = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"81\" height=\"37\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/8/0b8e0ab08536af23c91b7138d06ba8e3d963c9ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{1}{2}a + \\frac{1}{2}b + c = 2015 \\implies -a+b + 2c = 4030$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"373\" height=\"37\" />. Looking at imaginary parts, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/d/0bd5a3fbb37cc2b5610b3b60afea6bc719b259c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Im}(\\omega^2) = \\text{Im}(\\omega) = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"174\" height=\"41\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/a/44a247f301b0405ec73c2012f94fdf24f963d3b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}(a+b) = 2019\\sqrt{3} \\implies a+b = 4038$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"315\" height=\"41\" />. As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> do not exceed 2019, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/3/dc38c5413f63084fd8f83ed1e30a89c1e1dabe7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2019$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/4/364deb4f3788963c9b7f76ac405cbf8006c013ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 2019$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/b/8cb9cd819555306ecdd8354de1fcca33d4076ae8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = \\frac{4030}{2} = 2015$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"132\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/4/824ad5339388a6f17b0b7501cd33dcf36fda7d11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = 4038 + 2015 = 6053 \\implies f(1) \\pmod{1000} = \\boxed{053}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"460\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>-scrabbler94\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Denote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7f33f0d97240e6ec8ca5b0de5dd7c92eff1be11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"68\" height=\"43\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/d/54d7d48553f4d9e7ab418118607ea324cbfddfda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>By using the quadratic formula (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/3/5c3f79c3ee782ff47d13afab1991e37af1904ab9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"126\" height=\"40\" />) in reverse, we can find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/d/54d7d48553f4d9e7ab418118607ea324cbfddfda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> is the solution to a quadratic equation of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/1/98172d1b54b563033d26dc22c407dad4d4802be5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+bx+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/a/02aec86b54e3746abb7287df4a6e74c864abec87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a=2$\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/e/c9ec18aacd44a67831d63829b03adc48690646c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/3/67378bd4bebf48f548db0e3481f86da0b13b17a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2-4ac=-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"111\" height=\"15\" />. This clearly solves to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/9/35936109f5553f9d3a884aba528e07ec8408c187.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e4cc644ec8a1c3623c13ed3d14904096a0d87b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/d/54d7d48553f4d9e7ab418118607ea324cbfddfda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> solves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/e/98e5f7614c160535ad235368ae863ead8f54b24e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-x+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Multiplying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/e/98e5f7614c160535ad235368ae863ead8f54b24e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-x+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/cccb103143393c0119f5ab61d6d53a852ce70fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> on both sides yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/4/c244707ad87f42b5ed259c3893395dd6433b31f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" />. Muliplying this by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/c/b2cbcc72123b06a9f53671c96f56c082cb39006b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" /> on both sides yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/1/d617a70a9415db4573bee13fba5fa761a5025c70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^6-1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/8/5a86d425fd6ecb89613f8ef31ed578500d3927cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^6=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/729486329d44095f22386df475fff55dfaf6c206.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega^6=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>We can use this to simplify the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/5/5659fa289cf07c9ef1e9e2aab1359e090527eca3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\omega^{2018}+b\\omega^{2017}+c\\omega^{2016}=f(\\omega)=2015+2019\\sqrt{3}i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"397\" height=\"21\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/2/5f24e3943c1e600b6356fbd24b8b8982464ae529.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\omega^2+b\\omega+c=2015+2019\\sqrt{3}i.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"254\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>As in Solution 1, we use the values <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/c/24c09e32aa1cd6f417ae9f76133f2d20a7c0e1aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega=\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"105\" height=\"41\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57e3ae587fc598f1046a1747974aacd50eccd4a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega^2=-\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"127\" height=\"41\" /> to find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/f/4af02bb9249a7b0f9754dcf09cab7b8aa2ad00d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{1}{2}a+\\frac{1}{2}b+c=2015$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"170\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/16900e343661cc63f013baf273311d09069bab3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}a+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}b=2019\\sqrt{3} \\implies a+b=4038.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"334\" height=\"41\" /> Since neither <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> nor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> can exceed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/9/f49e1f42131f302f2b4a45393cdc3fed5be2655c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2019$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />, they must both be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/9/f49e1f42131f302f2b4a45393cdc3fed5be2655c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2019$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are equal, they cancel out in the first equation, resulting in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/a/6da3616f1f510c3e731bf3f89a09b67b7587fdf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=2015$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/2/d82795c7d204e22a9034cdef348f6f0a03c4cbf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=a+b+c=2019+2019+2015=6053$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"365\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/2/12286b212ccde3277ba59b756a3588f270387b0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6053\\bmod1000=\\boxed{053}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"181\" height=\"23\" />. ~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Emerald_block\" title=\"User:Emerald block\">emerald_block</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Calculate the first few powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7f33f0d97240e6ec8ca5b0de5dd7c92eff1be11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"68\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/b/06bd2ef9e66172cb05f7740a537947a43c7d7dcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2})^1=\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"175\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/4/2f42ac6d8a94eaec7a802053b0ab7a5fceea5f3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2})^2=\\frac{-1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"189\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/a/5ea353f38c46b11bc89bf7170799f5a97ea09071.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2})^3=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"133\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/c/b2c4f5fd87f3986dbe2a15727d7f87e1f68afdac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2})^4=\\frac{-1-\\sqrt{3}i}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"189\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/e/c9e7204461b25ccd9b868814944850fed3a7df1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2})^5=\\frac{1-\\sqrt{3}i}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"175\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5bc8b0993fe9a9916fd727a4571a2450dfacbd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2})^6=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"123\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>We figure that the power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7f33f0d97240e6ec8ca5b0de5dd7c92eff1be11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"68\" height=\"43\" /> repeats in a cycle 6.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/7/96703348b5f228458b1da5973eb738e2408d3e16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2})=(a(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2})^2+b(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2})+c)(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2})^{2016}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"471\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Since 2016 is a multiple of 6, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e4a3b6e3eee475b19e2f4154dbb4dc967bbf71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2})^{2016}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"139\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/1/211a88339dc2f92ba16e3475d5174d9b477669c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2})=a(\\frac{-1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2})+b(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2})+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"359\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/7/ac71e228d5b748990c692509dd08b23fa92333e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2})=(-\\frac{1}{2}a+\\frac{1}{2}b+c)+(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}i}{2}a+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}i}{2}b)=2015+2019\\sqrt{3}i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"536\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/f/4af02bb9249a7b0f9754dcf09cab7b8aa2ad00d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{1}{2}a+\\frac{1}{2}b+c=2015$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"170\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/1/a418b564af0492cc8f0027585994cb3983971f11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}i}{2}a+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}i}{2}b=2019\\sqrt{3}i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"202\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Using the first equation, we can get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/d/fcdd4f84485beec9c7a4ba93e80c57243a46218c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-a+b+2c=4030$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"152\" height=\"14\" />, and using the second equation, we can get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/f/1efc34546a81c86b4839aba61e91794d1bec976d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=4038$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"99\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Since all coefficients are less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/9/f49e1f42131f302f2b4a45393cdc3fed5be2655c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2019$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/2/91278349222ed972973f747de3e5a07d0991e731.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=2019$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"101\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/e/37e1d81158615d597f11a906f179413a44927b83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2c=4030$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/a/6da3616f1f510c3e731bf3f89a09b67b7587fdf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=2015$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/2/d82795c7d204e22a9034cdef348f6f0a03c4cbf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=a+b+c=2019+2019+2015=6053$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"365\" height=\"18\" />, and the remainder when it divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/3/c539a88850f5a4125637649482f396b8edb0344e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{053}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II\" title=\"2019 AIME II\">2019 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2019 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2019\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Pro